63649/0011.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みり愛お誕生日おめでとう！\nいつもニコニコしながら\n私の所に甘えにくるみり愛が\n可愛くて大好き♡♡\nいじるのはいいけどほどほどに\nしてね...笑\nまた焼肉行こうね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2014/11/01/2163649/0012.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと江野沢愛美ちゃん。\nお誕生日おめでとうございます〜\n18歳で同い年！\nまたお話したいです♡♡\nあといつか雑誌とかで一緒に\n載れたらいいなっていう密かな夢。\nみよまなが1月号のSeventeenで\n表紙らしいの٩꒰｡•◡•｡꒱۶\n絶対読む〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2014/11/01/2163649/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ではでは11月も\n寒さに負けず頑張りましょう☪\nコメントしてくれなきゃ..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2014/11/01/2163649/0014.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"食べちゃうぞっ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/miona.hori/img/blog/miona.hori/img/2014/11/01/2163649/0015.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみおな(ヽ´ω`)"}],"source":"archive"}